  "Chompy Makes a Game\n\nChompy wants to make a game with five stones. Chompy draws a line and puts a cup on its side. Chompy slides a stone from the line to the cup. The stone stops before the cup. Chompy moves the cup closer to the line. The next stone goes into the cup.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/d6b8bd02878303b26017.mp3",
