  "Muddy and the Rain Pail\n\nMuddy puts a pail, a small bucket, outside in the rain. Muddy wants the water for a small plant. The pail has a hole in the bottom. Water drips out. Muddy puts a bowl under the pail. The bowl catches the water. Muddy can water the plant without waiting for more rain.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/d716cf01deda34331dd9.mp3",
