  "Chompy in the Snow\n\nChompy rolls a ball of snow down a low hill. The snowball gets bigger as it rolls. It rolls fast towards a row of stones. Chompy puts more snow in front of the ball. The ball hits the snow and starts to slow down. It stops before it hits the stones.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/d3593da9fbc406ced5a5.mp3",
