  "Muddy Fills the Hay Rack\n\nMuddy helps at a farm for a day. Dry hay is in a tray by the rabbit pen. Muddy fills the rack with hay. Some hay falls onto the floor outside the pen. Muddy sweeps it up and puts it in a bucket. The rabbits pull hay from the rack and eat.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/eefcc981beb3c45e4fd8.mp3",
